  - elementId: slide-7-node-170-Text-10
    elementType: text
    bounds:
      - 604.8
      - 147.6
      - 309.6
      - 345.6
    content:
      fontFamily: Calibri
      fontSize: 11
      color: '#0D9488'
      align:
        - left
        - top
      wrap: true
      text: '<p><span style="color:#0D9488;font-size:11px;font-family:Calibri;font-weight:700">Step (1) </span><span style="color:#1F2937;font-size:10.5px;font-family:Calibri">编码器输出 4 路 skip 特征 + 1 路瓶颈 x_c。skip 服务解码器各级; x_c 是经过 CNN-Swin 融合、跨尺度回流、FFC 与高频增强的瓶颈特征。</span></p><p><span style="color:#0D9488;font-size:11px;font-family:Calibri;font-weight:700">Step (2) </span><span style="color:#1F2937;font-size:10.5px;font-family:Calibri">GradientDecoder 同时产出: 梯度图 g (监督 Sobel(x))、高光概率 s (监督 gt_specular)、4 个中间特征 xe1..xe4。</span></p><p><span style="color:#0D9488;font-size:11px;font-family:Calibri;font-weight:700">Step (3) </span><span style="color:#1F2937;font-size:10.5px;font-family:Calibri">EnhancementLayers 把 xe1..xe4 转换为高光重建相关的 enh1..enh4, 并通过 g/x/s 的双层门控聚焦在“高光相关结构突变”区域。</span></p><p><span style="color:#0D9488;font-size:11px;font-family:Calibri;font-weight:700">Step (4) </span><span style="color:#1F2937;font-size:10.5px;font-family:Calibri">主解码器汇聚 c_features + enh + 三路先验 + SpecAware; 分出两个输出头: b (高光) 与 r_direct (直接漫反射)。</span></p><p><span style="color:#0D9488;font-size:11px;font-family:Calibri;font-weight:700">Step (5) </span><span style="color:#1F2937;font-size:10.5px;font-family:Calibri">α 决定信任 r_direct 还是 r_sub; 融合后再用 RefinementHead 做受限残差精修 (系数 0.15)。</span></p><p><span style="color:#0D9488;font-size:11px;font-family:Calibri;font-weight:700">Step (6) </span><span style="color:#1F2937;font-size:10.5px;font-family:Calibri">cs 仅参与训练损失, 约束 H/4、H/8、H/16 融合特征响应保持一致, 提升跨尺度泛化。</span></p>'
    sourceLayout: 238bed2bfb7f44c8bdd58efd3a48d993a9c39916b226932cdcce84a86a21c0c3
